cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ANOUK: Online presentation of choice-based conjoint studies for LimeSurvey and other survey tools"
abstract: >-
  ANOUK (Auswahlbasierte Nutzenmessung: Online-Umsetzung & Kalkulation) is a
  lightweight PHP/MySQL web application that presents the choice tasks of
  choice-based conjoint studies designed in R with cbcTools. Respondents arrive
  from a survey tool with their ID and return to the same survey; the data are
  exported in long and wide format for estimation in R.
